Description: Reads, writes, and validates Croissant metadata, the MLCommons
    vocabulary for describing machine learning datasets in JSON for Linked Data
    (JSON-LD), described in Akhtar et al. (2024) <doi:10.1145/3650203.3663326>.
    Croissant 1.0 and 1.1 documents are represented as 'S7' objects and written
    back as JSON-LD. Validation reports the errors and warnings of each node.
    Record sets are read as tables from CSV, TSV, JSON, JSON Lines, and Parquet
    files, local or downloaded, including files in zip and tar archives, with
    checksum verification. Metadata can be generated from a data frame, and the
    metadata and files of 'Hugging Face' datasets are read from the Hub.
